*E_NAME			"Warehouse Dunkun"

*E_CHAT			"I wish to be Verkan's pupil someday and fight as one of the mercenary."
*E_CHAT			"Your warehouses in every town are  being shared with each other."
*E_CHAT			"Sometimes I just want to rest, but  it takes away my fatigue when I see you happy to get items back from me."
*E_CHAT			"Bless Castle has tall and solid     walls to protect itself well."
